                                           <div data-a-expander-name="book_description_expander" data-a-expander-collapsed-height="280" class="a-expander-collapsed-height a-row a-expander-container a-spacing-base a-expander-partial-collapse-container" style="max-height:280px"> <div data-expanded="false" class="a-expander-content a-expander-partial-collapse-content"> <span class="a-text-bold">Fall leaves, pumpkin spice, spooky nights, and twinkling Christmas lights – all in one cozy coloring book!</span><span><br/><br/>Relax and unwind through the magical 'ber months with 51 charming, Bold, and Easy designs for all skill levels.</span><p><span class="a-text-bold">Celebrate the coziest time of the year – all in one coloring book!</span><span><br/>From crisp September mornings to festive December nights, </span><span class="a-text-italic">Cozy Girl Season</span><span> is your perfect companion for the magical ‘ber months (September–December).</span></p><p><span>This </span><span class="a-text-bold">Bold and Easy coloring book</span><span> is filled with charming, stress-free designs that capture the warmth of fall, the fun of Halloween, and the magic of Christmas. Perfect for adults, teens, and anyone who loves simple, bold lines that are easy to color and relaxing to enjoy.</span></p><p><span class="a-text-bold">Inside you’ll find:</span></p><ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical"><li><span class="a-list-item"><p><span class="a-text-bold">Fall vibes</span><span> – pumpkins, warm drinks, and autumn leaves</span></p></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><p><span class="a-text-bold">Halloween fun</span><span> – Spooky cookies, treats, and spooky-cute decor</span></p></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><p><span class="a-text-bold">Christmas cheer</span><span> – ornaments, gifts, wreaths, and other cozy Christmas designs</span></p></span></li></ul><p><span class="a-text-bold">Why you’ll love it:</span></p><ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical"><li><span class="a-list-item"><p><span>Bold lines & simple shapes – easy on the eyes and stress-free to color</span></p></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><p><span>51 unique designs – perfect for markers, crayons, or colored pencils</span></p></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><p><span>Great for beginners and experienced colorists alike</span></p></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><p><span>A perfect cozy gift for friends, family, or yourself</span></p></span></li></ul><p><span>Curl up with a blanket, grab your favorite markers, and enjoy the magic of </span><span class="a-text-italic">Cozy Girl Season</span><span>!</span></p><span><br/>Book Details:</span><ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical"><li><span class="a-list-item"><span>Premium Glossy Cover</span></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><span>8.5 x 8.5 inches</span></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><span>Single-sided for less bleed-through</span></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><span>51 simple designs with thick lines</span></span></li></ul><span><br/>Kindly note: This coloring book is designed for use with colored pencils, gel pens, and crayons. If you plan to use bleed-prone products like alcohol markers, I recommend placing a protective sheet behind the page to safeguard subsequent pages. To accommodate potential color bleed, all illustrations in this book are printed single-sided.<br/><br/>Check out my other books in the Cozy Girl series by clicking the author name "Jeanett Veronica."</span>  </div> <div class="a-expander-header a-expander-partial-collapse-header"><div class="a-expander-content-fade"></div><a href="javascript:void(0)" role="button" data-action="a-expander-toggle" class="a-declarative" data-a-expander-toggle="{&quot;allowLinkDefault&quot;:true, &quot;expand_prompt&quot;:&quot;Read more&quot;, &quot;collapse_prompt&quot;:&quot;Read less&quot;}"><i class="a-icon a-icon-extender-expand"></i><span class="a-expander-prompt">Read more</span></a></div> </div>              