                              <td class="apm-tablemodule-valuecell" style="width:191px;"> <span class="a-size-base"> Less deciding, more creating—Letter Dotting turns coloring into a simple, calming, guided escape.  </span> </td>          <td class="apm-tablemodule-valuecell" style="width:191px;"> <span class="a-size-base"> Mindfulness simplifies the process: choose your colors once, assign them to each unique line type, and simply follow the lines.  </span> </td>          <td class="apm-tablemodule-valuecell" style="width:191px;"> <span class="a-size-base">  Featuring vibrant lines that guide you through the illustrations, it makes the coloring process both easier and more enjoyable.  </span> </td>          <td class="apm-tablemodule-valuecell" style="width:191px;"> <span class="a-size-base"> Within its beautiful pages, you&#039;ll discover creative designs featuring a variety of shapes and zentangle doodle patterns.   </span> </td>          <td class="apm-tablemodule-valuecell" style="width:191px;"> <span class="a-size-base"> This book takes you on a journey through a perfectly cozy day, from wandering down a little farm path, having a riverside picnic, and then heading inside to warm your toes by the heater.  </span> </td>        </tr>
