<!--CardsClient--><div class="_about-the-author-card_style_cardParentDiv__2LpV1" id="CardInstanceEMI510ll5Es3Tvgc_daeVA" data-card-metrics-id="about-the-author-card_DetailPage_2" data-acp-params="tok=_d6qHDgmUY6kQFB1EuFYlTEBy1nyrt-tg4q8mLIjd18;ts=1792241763760;rid=87GXC5RVV1KYM98EX9Q3;d1=900;d2=0" data-acp-path="/acp/about-the-author-card/about-the-author-card-a89842b7-c30d-4920-8f67-20424174678f-1791851843238/" data-acp-tracking="{}" data-acp-stamp="1792241763782"><bds-render-context-provider theme="light" devicetype="desktop"><hr aria-hidden="true" class="a-divider-normal"/><h2 id="books-entity-teaser">About the author</h2><div class="_about-the-author-card_style_subtitleDiv__1KAwA"><span>Follow authors for new release and deal updates, plus improved recommendations. </span><span class="_about-the-author-card_style_whylineURL__1-OxW"><a class="a-link-normal" href="/your-books/?_encoding=UTF8&amp;tabView=following&amp;ref_=aufs_dp_mata_dsk_yb_yf">See updates from all followed authors in Your Books.</a></span></div><div class="_about-the-author-card_style_cardContentDiv__FXLPd"><div class="a-section singleAuthorSection"><div class="a-section"><div class="a-fixed-left-grid"><div class="a-fixed-left-grid-inner" style="padding-left:130px"><div class="a-fixed-left-grid-col a-col-left" style="width:130px;margin-left:-130px;float:left"><div class="a-section _about-the-author-card_carouselItemStyles_authorImageContainer__2QL56"><div class="a-row a-spacing-small"><img alt="Vivi Tinta" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amzn-author-media-prod/10f7otsac2sip3mko15eud4ean._SY600_._SL200_._PQ50_._FMwebp_.jpg" class="_about-the-author-card_carouselItemStyles_authorImage__3jKLX"/></div></div><div data-authorasin="B0CJQD59RP" data-reftag="aufs_dp_mata_dsk_yb_yf" class="a-section a-text-center followButtonColumn"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div><div class="a-fixed-left-grid-col a-col-right" style="padding-left:0%;float:left"><div class="a-section _about-the-author-card_carouselItemStyles_authorName__HSb1t"><a class="a-size-large a-link-normal" href="/Vivi-Tinta/e/B0CJQD59RP/ref=aufs_dp_mata_dsk"><h2>Vivi Tinta</h2></a></div><div class="a-row a-spacing-base a-spacing-top-medium a-grid-vertical-align a-grid-center"><div class="a-cardui-deck" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div class="a-cardui _about-the-author-card_carouselItemStyles_expander__3Fm-M" data-a-card-type="peekExpand"><div class="a-cardui-body"><div class="a-reactive-container"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized _about-the-author-card_carouselItemStyles_peekableContent__hWM3i" data-a-max-height="80" style="max-height:80px"><p>Hey there!</p><p> Welcome to Vivi Tinta&#x27;s World!</p><p>Vivi Tinta started as one small artist who was all about spreading fun and making people smile in our busy world. I&#x27;m also just a girl who loves to draw and color stuff. I&#x27;m really into cute things and just chilling out.</p><p>On my journey, my initial small dream grew bigger. I wanted to bring joy and peaceful moments to more people. I met and connected with many friends who shared my passion, and together we spend our days drawing, coloring, and sharing little life stories. </p><p>Our simple wish is that through each soft line and gentle color, you will feel more connected and relaxed and enjoy moments of calm. Coloring is not only for relaxation but also to connect with yourself, your loved ones, and others, making each day flow more gently.</p><p>We create for quiet souls who find joy in little things—for lovers of soft colors, slow days, and sweet moments of calm. Whether you&#x27;re unwinding, expressing yourself, or simply seeking coziness through coloring, this space is yours. You&#x27;re not just filling pages with color—you&#x27;re creating your own gentle moments of peace. </p></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-cardui-footer"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="display:none">Read more about this author</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less about this author</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></bds-render-context-provider></div><script>if(window.mix_csa){window.mix_csa('[cel_widget_id="about-the-author-card_DetailPage_2"]', '#CardInstanceEMI510ll5Es3Tvgc_daeVA')('mark', 'be')}</script>
